---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Veritrail — The trust & control plane for AI agents"
  description="Tamper-evident audit, pre-crime policy simulation, and cryptographic receipts for production AI agents."
>
  <Nav />

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>The trust &amp; control plane for AI agents</h1>
        <p class="lede">
          Veritrail gives platform and security teams hash-chained audit, pre-deploy
          policy simulation, and cryptographically signed receipts for every action an
          AI agent takes in production.
        </p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a href="https://console.veritrail.io/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Start free</a>
          <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-secondary">Read the docs</a>
        </div>
        <p class="microcopy">No credit card. 10,000 events/month on the free tier, forever.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="16" rx="2"/>
                <path d="M3 10h18M8 4v16"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Tamper-evident audit</h3>
            <p>
              Every agent event is appended to a per-project hash chain. Any rewritten
              history is mathematically detectable at audit time — and verifiable
              offline with our open CLI.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2v6M12 16v6M4.93 4.93l4.24 4.24M14.83 14.83l4.24 4.24M2 12h6M16 12h6"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Pre-crime policy simulator</h3>
            <p>
              Replay last month's agent traffic against a policy change before you
              ship it. See exactly which tool calls would have been blocked and which
              users would have been impacted — in seconds, not days.
            </p>
          </article>

          <article class="feature">
            <div class="icon" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg width="32" height="32" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 21l-6-4-6 4 1.5-7.5L2 9h7z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Cryptographic receipts</h3>
            <p>
              Each completed agent run is sealed into a signed Receipt — input,
              policy decisions, tool outputs, model identity. Verify with a public key
              outside our infrastructure for compliance evidence that survives.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="quote">
      <div class="container">
        <blockquote>
          <p>
            &ldquo;Before Veritrail, our auditors took a screenshot of a Datadog
            dashboard. Now we hand them a signed Receipt that proves a specific model,
            on a specific policy, refused a specific action at a specific time.
            That's the difference between &lsquo;we think it&rsquo; and &lsquo;we can prove it.&rsquo;&rdquo;
          </p>
          <footer>
            <strong>Marisol Tan</strong> — Director of AI Governance, Northstead Financial
          </footer>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="bottom-cta">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ship agents your security team can defend.</h2>
        <p>Free tier includes 10,000 events/month, one project, and the full audit ledger.</p>
        <a href="https://console.veritrail.io/signup" class="btn btn-primary">Start free</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: 5rem 0 3rem;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f7faff 0%, #ffffff 100%);
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    max-width: 620px;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
  }
  .cta-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .microcopy {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
  }

  .features {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  .feature {
    padding: 1.75rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: #fff;
  }
  .feature .icon {
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .feature h3 { margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  .feature p { color: var(--fg-muted); margin: 0; }

  .quote {
    background: var(--bg-alt);
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }
  blockquote {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  blockquote p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  blockquote footer {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--fg-muted);
  }

  .bottom-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }
  .bottom-cta p {
    color: var(--fg-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .feature-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero { padding: 3rem 0 2rem; }
    .lede { font-size: 1.1rem; }
  }
</style>
